  "id": "educational-placement",
  "term": "educational placement",
  "definition": "Educational placement refers to securing an opportunity for a young person to enter a school or training setting as part of education, employment, and training support services. In this context, it means helping youth obtain a place in education as a step toward longer-term school and job opportunities.",
